    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/2daa55171c1b41f65816edff0ea29425.poster.avif?t=1698110215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/2daa55171c1b41f65816edff0ea29425.webm?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/2daa55171c1b41f65816edff0ea29425.mp4?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>If you liked this game and want to know when it's demo and full version released then please <strong>wishlist now</strong>!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/0enter.gif?t=1698110215\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER A LIFE STRUGGLE IN ANOTHER WORLD</strong></h2>Welcome to a world inspired by Forager, where you can only wake up once a year due to a curse! Wake up, explore, loot, build, expand, defend your region by fighting goblins, sleep, and repeat!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/423c3fa7a46e467cfec9d99cf4b2dc7a.poster.avif?t=1698110215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/423c3fa7a46e467cfec9d99cf4b2dc7a.webm?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/423c3fa7a46e467cfec9d99cf4b2dc7a.mp4?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND AND BUILD</strong></h2>Build your town and establish its population! Construct watchtowers, archer towers, barracks, station villagers, and be prepared for dangers while you sleep for a year!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/e32a57c8670b6318da1df09d34fa8920.poster.avif?t=1698110215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/e32a57c8670b6318da1df09d34fa8920.webm?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/e32a57c8670b6318da1df09d34fa8920.mp4?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT ITEMS</strong></h2>Craft various tools and equipment using collected resources! These items will help you collect more resources and grow!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/096cdcbf21e730d674b403ebc0128512.poster.avif?t=1698110215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/096cdcbf21e730d674b403ebc0128512.webm?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/096cdcbf21e730d674b403ebc0128512.mp4?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRADE</strong></h2>Merchants pass through the region from time to time. Buy different resources from these traders or sell your own!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/1e6c1613ba39839268e64ad9e0807d9f.poster.avif?t=1698110215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/1e6c1613ba39839268e64ad9e0807d9f.webm?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/1e6c1613ba39839268e64ad9e0807d9f.mp4?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GOBLINS ARE COMING</strong></h2>This world is full of various enemies you may encounter! Defend the region by defeating attacking enemies like goblins!<br><br><br><i>&quot;Every awakening is a new adventure, every rebirth is an opportunity to become stronger!&quot;</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/0enter.gif?t=1698110215\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER A LIFE STRUGGLE IN ANOTHER WORLD</strong></h2>Welcome to a world inspired by Forager, where you can only wake up once a year due to a curse! Wake up, explore, loot, build, expand, defend your region by fighting goblins, sleep, and repeat!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/423c3fa7a46e467cfec9d99cf4b2dc7a.poster.avif?t=1698110215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/423c3fa7a46e467cfec9d99cf4b2dc7a.webm?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/423c3fa7a46e467cfec9d99cf4b2dc7a.mp4?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND AND BUILD</strong></h2>Build your town and establish its population! Construct watchtowers, archer towers, barracks, station villagers, and be prepared for dangers while you sleep for a year!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/e32a57c8670b6318da1df09d34fa8920.poster.avif?t=1698110215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/e32a57c8670b6318da1df09d34fa8920.webm?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/e32a57c8670b6318da1df09d34fa8920.mp4?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT ITEMS</strong></h2>Craft various tools and equipment using collected resources! These items will help you collect more resources and grow!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/096cdcbf21e730d674b403ebc0128512.poster.avif?t=1698110215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/096cdcbf21e730d674b403ebc0128512.webm?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/096cdcbf21e730d674b403ebc0128512.mp4?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRADE</strong></h2>Merchants pass through the region from time to time. Buy different resources from these traders or sell your own!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/1e6c1613ba39839268e64ad9e0807d9f.poster.avif?t=1698110215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/1e6c1613ba39839268e64ad9e0807d9f.webm?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338360/extras/1e6c1613ba39839268e64ad9e0807d9f.mp4?t=1698110215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GOBLINS ARE COMING</strong></h2>This world is full of various enemies you may encounter! Defend the region by defeating attacking enemies like goblins!<br><br><br><i>&quot;Every awakening is a new adventure, every rebirth is an opportunity to become stronger!&quot;</i>",
